  #line-at(70.8pt, 144.24pt, "and probe laser beams, directed from below, passed through the transparent glass substrate and ")
  #line-at(70.8pt, 164.88pt, "were focused at the glass-Al interface. Liquid films were applied on the upper surface of the Al ")
